abstract: "An ongoing mathematical-physics research program developing a falsifiable test architecture for physical-to-experiential bridge claims. The repository formalizes deterministic and stochastic factorization tests, intervention-resolved causal structure, temporal and multiscale compatibility, finite-data certification, quantum operational sufficiency tests, adaptive experiment design, and certified calibration and optimization. The current experimental-design frontier includes lower-bounded heterogeneous calibration and exact primal-dual gap decomposition. The current documented theorem frontier is P70. The physical-to-experiential bridge remains open, and the project does not assume that consciousness is a scalar, state of matter, quantum variable, or additional spacetime dimension."
